OL,4,CLandlord finds 'absolutely shocking'   
OL,5,Cscenes after tenant wrecks property    
OL,6,GA landlord said she was left "in       
OL,7,Gshock" after her tenant left her home  
OL,8,Gin "an absolute mess", including dog   
OL,9,Gpoo all over the house.                
OL,11,FIsabelle Williams, 24, said she could  
OL,12,Fnot believe what she was faced with as 
OL,13,Fshe opened the door to her property in 
OL,14,FNewcastle Emlyn, Carmarthenshire, on   
OL,15,FTuesday.                               
OL,17,FThe self-employed carpenter and tiler  
OL,18,Fsaid dog mess was "everywhere" and all 
OL,19,Fof the furniture was damaged. Now,     
OL,20,FIsabelle wants to see more support for 
OL,21,Flandlords in Wales who face similar    
OL,22,Fissues with their tenants.        G1/4 
