OL,4,CMidwives told to expect fewer jobs as  
OL,5,Crecruitment drive is paused            
OL,6,GMidwives who will graduate in Wales    
OL,7,Gnext year have been told there are     
OL,8,Gfewer jobs available for them than     
OL,9,Gexpected.                              
OL,11,FThe Royal College of Midwives (RCM)    
OL,12,Fsaid this was in addition to the 66    
OL,13,Fnewly qualified midwives who did not   
OL,14,Fmanage to find a job after they        
OL,15,Fgraduated last year.                   
OL,17,FDirector of RCM Cymru Julie Richards   
OL,18,Fsaid the situation was "unacceptable"  
OL,19,Fwhen maternity services were "facing   
OL,20,Fpressure from every direction".        
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
